/P 96 0 R
/E (Based on the identified limitations of existing harvesting systems, the functional and design requirements of the proposed solution were defined. Key requirements include selective harvesting of pluckable shoots, preservation of immature shoots such as Arimbu, lightweight and ergonomic operation, adaptability to uneven terrain, and minimization of leaf and bush damage. These requirements were used as the primary criteria for concept generation and evaluation.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
